@startuml resource-relationships
hide circle
hide empty members
skinparam linetype ortho
title How UZ Core resources relate

class Patient
class EpisodeOfCare
class Encounter
class Condition
class Observation
class Procedure
class MedicationRequest
class Composition
class Specimen
class ServiceRequest

Patient "1" o-- "0..*" EpisodeOfCare : « patient »
EpisodeOfCare "0..1" o-- "0..*" Encounter : « episodeOfCare »

Encounter "1" o-- "0..*" Condition : « encounter »
Encounter "1" o-- "0..*" Observation : « encounter »
Encounter "1" o-- "0..*" Procedure : « encounter »
Encounter "1" o-- "0..*" MedicationRequest : « encounter »
Encounter "1" o-- "0..1" Composition : « encounter »

Observation "0..*" --> "0..1" Specimen : « specimen »
Specimen "0..*" --> "0..1" ServiceRequest : « request »

note as N
  Each label is the FHIR reference element on the
  child that points back to its parent.
  A diamond marks the "owning" resource.
end note
@enduml
